  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>y</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8704;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mi>y</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math> is an arbitrary constant and&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math> Then,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "an odd function",
      "is_correct": false
    },
